    <string name="cleanup_snippets_help">Say a trigger phrase and it\'s replaced by your saved text, exactly as written, line breaks included.\n\n• Triggers match whole words in any case: “my email” matches “My email” but not “my emailing”.\n• In Chinese and Japanese, which have no spaces between words, a trigger also matches inside a sentence. In Korean it also matches with a particle attached: “메일” matches “메일을”.\n• Nothing else changes the saved text: no filler removal, commands or capitals.\n• Said on its own, only the saved text is inserted.</string>
