    <string name="onboarding_futo_manual_body">In FUTO Keyboard, open Settings → Voice Input and turn on “Disable built-in voice input” (“Use voice input provided by external app”). FUTO\'s microphone button then opens the Marmalade voice keyboard from the previous step.</string>
